{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫（TVB）人氣戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》自開播以來話題不斷，原本備受關注的《東張西望》主持俞可程（Kan …</p><p></p>\n<p>無綫（TVB）人氣戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》自開播以來話題不斷，原本備受關注的《東張西望》主持俞可程（Kanis），近日卻被爆出疑似隱瞞感情狀況「扮單身」，暗中與已離婚的無綫綜藝科高級導演鄭韜畧（Marcus）拍拖。風波發酵後，節目組火速將其出鏡畫面全數刪走；面對連日負評，俞可程於11月27日在社交平台限時動態上載全黑背景聲明，正式宣布主動退出《女神配對計劃2》。</p>\n<h2>黑底白字發聲明 否認謠言主動退賽</h2>\n<p>俞可程在聲明中致歉，指近日的新聞佔用了大眾時間，亦令《女神配對計劃2》的節目焦點受影響。雖然她重申「網上新聞傳的謠言均不屬實」，但經過與公司及節目組慎重商討後，為免個人新聞分散觀眾對台前幕後心血的注意力，決定主動要求退出，並表示未來會更專注於工作上。</p>\n<h2>重本AI新作《東張三俠》成焦點</h2>\n<p>隨著俞可程退出真人騷，大批網民隨即將焦點轉移至另一部由她擔正的重頭製作——無綫旗下FF工作室全力打造的50集AI微短劇《東張三俠》。該劇早前已被列入《TVB節目巡禮2027》重點推介綜藝及微短劇項目，屬於公司重本投資的創新之作。</p>\n<h2>化身俠義女將 改編真實社會奇案</h2>\n<p>《東張三俠》以《東張西望》為藍本，講述三位心懷俠義的女子——熱血KOL Maggie（梁敏巧 飾）、剛柔並濟的健身教練Kanis（俞可程 飾）及洞察入微的社工Eris（鄧凱文 飾），獲《東張西望》金牌監製祥哥發掘並接受特訓後正式集結。三人聯手追查改編自真實社會案件的奇案，包括連夜追查「天光墟黑心壽司案」、臥底滲透「難民食物卡詐騙案」，以及正面對峙哄騙無數少女的「寵物KOL」，在重重危機中堅持為民請命，演繹現代俠義精神。</p>\n<h2>AI造型還原度最高 會否「換臉」引熱議</h2>\n<p>由於《東張三俠》採用AI技術生成三位「東張女神」的虛擬角色並由真人聲演，而俞可程在劇中不僅戲份吃重，更是「三俠」中武力輸出最高的核心戰力，不少網民更直言在三人AI造型當中，以俞可程的角色還原度最高、畫得最神似。如今她因感情風波退出《女神2》，不少觀眾與網民均十分關注這部50集AI重本製作的後續安排，紛紛討論劇組會否因今次風波而透過AI技術「換臉」易角，抑或維持原班人馬如期推出，令《東張三俠》的最終去向成為城中熱話。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987337894915938_13731689866aaf4ce3ef131.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 俞可程 《女神配對計劃2》五大女神之一俞可程（圖片來源：IG@kanissyu）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178987337894915938_13731689866aaf4ce3ef131.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>《女神配對計劃2》五大女神之一俞可程（圖片來源：IG@kanissyu）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179576519796443076_12940608686b0933ce8f723.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6073117124604927247.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179576519796443076_12940608686b0933ce8f723.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179576519953377599_5957145826b0933d02ef63.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6073117124604927255.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179576519953377599_5957145826b0933d02ef63.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17957652015252950_6989034146b0933d2004cc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6073117124604927244.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17957652015252950_6989034146b0933d2004cc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179576520341322499_2559160966b0933d3f2f9b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6073117124604927246.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179576520341322499_2559160966b0933d3f2f9b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17957652052674562_8413292236b0933d5a26c4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6073117124604927251.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17957652052674562_8413292236b0933d5a26c4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17957652066748380_11148680256b0933d7174e8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6073117124604927253.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17957652066748380_11148680256b0933d7174e8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%bf%9e%e5%8f%af%e7%a8%8b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">俞可程</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e%e9%85%8d%e5%b0%8d%e8%a8%88%e5%8a%832/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">女神配對計劃2</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e5%bc%b5%e4%b8%89%e4%bf%a0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東張三俠</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3551037\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 27 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T09:04:04.106239+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1393,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T07:40:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T08:57:27.552947+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T08:57:27.552947+00:00","content_hash":"0bd371a151d3f5d08dafafb557e9658d44a79993400972c346c452e408ade2d7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}